OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with rain or
OL,6,Fshowers through the morning. Becoming
OL,7,Fdry for most as cloud breaks through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Light winds, though
OL,9,Fbreezy over hills, with near average
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy this evening
OL,13,Fwith some clear spells, though cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing overnight. Largely dry
OL,15,Fthrough the evening, but further
OL,16,Fshowers developing later. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
