OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain or showers moving
OL,7,Fnorth through the day, perhaps drier
OL,8,Flater. A strengthening easterly
OL,9,Fbreeze, though temperatures around
OL,10,Fnormal for the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,14,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,15,Frain or showers, and a gentle breeze.
OL,16,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,17,Fthe time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
